---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro'
import { contact } from '../data/site'
---

<Base title="Terms and refund policy | Tessera" description="Licence terms for Tessera and Tessera Pro, including the 14-day refund policy.">
  <Prose title="Terms and refund policy" intro="Effective 26 November 2026. Tessera is offered by Beyond Enterprises.">
    <h2>Tessera</h2>
    <p>The free version of Tessera lets you scan, map and search your storage without time limits.</p>

    <h2>Tessera Pro</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tessera Pro is a one-time purchase. It is not a subscription, and the licence does not expire.</li>
      <li>A licence can be active on one computer at a time. To move it, deactivate it in Settings on the old computer, then activate it on the new one.</li>
      <li>Updates are released at our discretion. A licence covers the Pro features of the version you bought and the updates we choose to provide for it; it does not promise free future major versions.</li>
      <li>Licence keys are for your own use. Please do not share, resell or publish them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Payment</h2>
    <p>Purchases are processed by Dodo Payments, which acts as the merchant of record. Dodo Payments' own terms also apply to the purchase.</p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>If you are not happy with Tessera Pro, you can ask for a full refund within 14 days of purchase, for any reason.</li>
      <li>Email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> with your order number or the email address you bought with.</li>
      <li>Refunds go back to your original payment method. Once a refund is made, the licence key stops working.</li>
      <li>After 14 days, we will still refund where the law requires it, or where Tessera Pro does not work as described and we cannot fix it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your files</h2>
    <p>Tessera moves items you choose to the Recycle Bin or Trash and never deletes them permanently, so they can be put back. Please review what you remove and keep backups of anything important. To the extent the law allows, our liability is limited to the amount you paid for Tessera Pro.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Beyond Enterprises, <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If these terms change, the new version will be published here with a new effective date. Changes do not take away a refund you were already entitled to.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
